            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For businesses like waste removal, construction, and landscaping, dump trailers are an essential piece of equipment. These trailers provide the reliability and efficiency you need to move materials quickly and effectively, helping you run your operations as smoothly as possible. But investing in the right dump trailer doesn't have to break the bank. Whether you're shopping for new or used, there are plenty of ways to find a high-quality dump trailer at a price that fits your budget. Let's explore the benefits of both options, what to look for in each, and how to reduce costs without sacrificing quality.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-new-benefits",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Benefits of Purchasing a New Trailer",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "new-benefits"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-new-benefits-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When considering costs for your business, buying a <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer&condition=new\">new dump trailer</a> can be a worthwhile investment that pays off over time. Although the upfront expense might be higher, the long-term advantages can make it a smart choice for many businesses. A new dump trailer is an excellent option if your business is well-established, you need a dump trailer for daily operations, or you're looking for long-lasting equipment with minimal maintenance. Let's take a closer look at the ways you can save by purchasing new.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-new-benefits-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "brief",
                    "across": "2",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Dependable",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "A new trailer comes with no history of wear and tear, ensuring that every component, from the hydraulic system to the tires, is in peak condition. Fewer repair costs, less downtime, and a manufacturer warranty come standard."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "More Financial Options",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Dealers often provide attractive financial incentives for new trailers, such as warranties, financing plans, or promotional discounts, making a new trailer more accessible."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Easier to Find Parts",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "New trailers come with readily available parts, making maintenance simpler and faster. No need to hunt down discontinued components."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Long-Lasting",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "A new trailer is built to last, making it a reliable addition to your fleet for years to come with consistent performance and value over time."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "marginBottom": 34
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-used-benefits",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Benefits of Purchasing a Used Trailer",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "used-benefits"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-used-benefits-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If lowering upfront costs is your priority, buying a used dump trailer can be a practical solution. Used trailers offer significant savings while still providing the functionality you need to get the job done. A used dump trailer is a great option if you're starting a new business and working with a limited budget, you don't need a dump trailer for daily operations, or you don't need a trailer for a long period of time. Here are some of the benefits you can expect from your used trailer.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-used-benefits-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "brief",
                    "across": "2",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Lower Upfront Costs",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Used trailers are generally more affordable, allowing you to invest your savings into other areas of your business."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Minimal Depreciation",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Unlike new trailers, which experience a sharp drop in value after purchase, used trailers maintain their value more steadily, especially if you plan to resell in the future."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Immediate Availability",
                        "points": [],
                        "wide": true,
                        "intro": "Sometimes new trailers require a waiting period for manufacturing or delivery. Used trailers are often available immediately, making them a great choice for businesses with urgent needs."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "marginBottom": 34
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-reduce-costs",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Additional Ways to Reduce Costs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "reduce-costs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reduce-costs-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you choose new or used, there are a few strategies to further reduce your costs. Be sure to look for trailers that come with warranties and only shop from a dealer you trust. A trustworthy dealer can guide you to the best deals and ensure you're getting a quality product. Once you get your trailer, be sure to regularly upkeep it to prevent costly repairs and extend the life of your trailer.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-get-your-business-going",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Get Your Business Going",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-get-your-business-going-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we're here to help you get the equipment you need to make your business thrive. Whether you're looking for a short-term rental, a dependable used trailer, or a brand-new model from top manufacturers like Hyundai Translead and Globe Trailers, we have you covered. Let us help you find the perfect trailer for your business, at a price that works for you. Ready to explore your options? Visit one of our locations or contact us today to learn how we can support your business with the right trailer.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
